>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On April 17th, our group of five students visited Biafo Tech Software House, and had the chance to chat with some professionals there. Each of us got to ask five questions about our topic. We talked about things like using software the wrong way and how it affects people. The people at Biafo Tech had a lot of good insights to share, which helped us understand our topic better. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 352 0 R
/ActualText (Online Data Collection and Tracking:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Biafo Tech showed us how our online actions leave traces, like cookies and tracking pixels. Knowing this helps us understand how our info gets gathered and used.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 353 0 R
/ActualText (Privacy Rights:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We learned about our rights to keep personal info private. Things like giving consent and knowing how our data is used help us stay in control.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 354 0 R
/ActualText (Data Protection Laws:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Biafo Tech explained laws like GDPR and CCPA. These laws help keep companies in check and give us more control over our info.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 355 0 R
/ActualText (Data Minimization and Anonymization:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Keeping data small and anonymous is key to staying safe. Biafo Tech taught us ways to limit what info is collected and how to make it harder to trace back to us.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 356 0 R
/ActualText (Data Breach Notification:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (If there's a data breach, it's important to know ASAP. Biafo Tech showed us how companies should tell us about breaches so we can protect ourselves.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During our visit, we asked the professionals at Biafo Tech our questions and learned a lot from their answers. Now we know how to protect our info online and why it matters. By understanding these lessons, we can all play a part in keeping our personal info safe in the digital world. This presentation shares what we learned and the best practices we discovered.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We hope this presentation will help others understand the importance of protecting personal information in today's digital world.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
